SUMMARY:Sunday Live Music: PORCH ROCKERS
DESCRIPTION:The Porch Rockers Band is a quartet that plays a blend of familiar blues\, bluegrass\, folk\, rock and Americana Music.\nThe band performs favorite songs from the last decades\, as performed by Willie Nelson\, Bob Dylan\, Patsy Cline\, CCR\, Bonnie Raitt\, Eric Clapton\, BB King\, Fleetwood Mac\, and many other artists.\nThe Porch Rockers Band consists of Angie Aumage on vocals and guitar\, Don Adkins on vocals and guitar\, Randy Gratz on bass\, and David Shank on vocals and drums.
URL:https://butlerwinery.com/event/sunday-live-music-porch-rockers-2/
END:VEVENT
